# upstream's six scene tests, in order on one screen; a boot takes 500ms
# scene 1: the engine is off, Start engine, no Stop, Compute disabled, no
# result (a compute on the disabled button clicks nothing)
@0 compute
# scene 2: Start engine boots, shows Stop and no Start
@100 start
# scenes 3 and 5: once booted (upstream's ManagedResource.acquire), the
# engine is ready with its id, Stop, and Compute enabled
@600 compute
# scene 4: the third compute shows 9 (upstream's model starts at 2)
@700 compute
@800 compute
# scene 5: Stop turns it off
@900 stop
# scene 6: a failed boot (upstream's failAcquire) shows the reason and
# Start engine
@1000 fault
@1100 start
@1600 compute
@1600 end
